WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.680
Reporting turns assessment work into decisions.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:09.940
AI can help draft clear findings, improve readability, organize evidence, and tailor language for different audiences.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:22.880
A strong finding should include the affected area, verified evidence, impact, severity reasoning, safe reproduction summary, assumptions, limitations, and practical remediation guidance.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.820
The analyst should review every word before delivery.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.520
Severity reasoning should be tied to context.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:38.820
A technical weakness may be more or less important depending on data sensitivity, exploitability within scope, user role, compensating controls, and business process.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:44.800
AI can help list factors to consider, but it should not assign final severity without verified context.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:48.860
The report should explain why the severity is appropriate, not simply label it.

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:53.080
Remediation guidance should be practical and connected to the confirmed issue.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:56.660
Vague statements like fix security do not help developers.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:03.440
Better guidance describes the control objective, suggests implementation direction, and acknowledges application context.

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:09.820
AI can help draft this language, but recommendations should be checked for feasibility and alignment with the client's technology stack.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.120
Communication matters throughout the engagement.

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:17.460
Executive summaries should describe risk and business relevance without unnecessary technical noise.

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:23.600
Developer-focused sections should provide enough detail to support repair without exposing unrelated sensitive material.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:29.020
Preserve evidence and assumptions so the client can understand the basis of each finding.

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:33.960
AI can polish the message, but the professional responsibility remains with the assessor.
